{"id":"839fa26e40680465","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-ultrapower-map.md","title":"ZFC Ultrapower Map","display":"df-zfc-ultrapower-map — ZFC Ultrapower Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ultrapower-map","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ultrapower-map"],"display":"df-zfc-ultrapower-map — ZFC Ultrapower Map","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-ultrapower]]","[[58-df-ultrafilter]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ultrapower-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ultrapower-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ultrapower-map — ZFC Ultrapower Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"80d22bbd3f726e33\" href=\"?note=80d22bbd3f726e33\" title=\"58-df-ultrapower\">58-df-ultrapower</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"58-df-ultrafilter\">58-df-ultrafilter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UltrapowerMap}_S\\subseteq V^{4}\">\\(\\mathrm{UltrapowerMap}_S\\subseteq V^{4}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,M,I,U\\in V\">\\(j,M,I,U\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" href=\"?note=5e8b8d97b21dd8e8\" title=\"58-df-ultrafilter\">58-df-ultrafilter</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}\\)</span> is the set-coded function predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M^I/U\">\\(M^I/U\\)</span> is the ultrapower carrier (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"80d22bbd3f726e33\" href=\"?note=80d22bbd3f726e33\" title=\"58-df-ultrapower\">58-df-ultrapower</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UltrapowerMap}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{UltrapowerMap}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> is the predicate defined here</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ultrapower\\text{-}map}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UltrapowerMap}_S(j,M,I,U)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,I)\\land\\operatorname{Function}(j,M,M^I/U)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in M\\;j(x)=\n\\{g\\in M^I:\\{i\\in I:g(i)=x\\}\\in U\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ultrapower\\text{-}map}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UltrapowerMap}_S(j,M,I,U)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,I)\\land\\operatorname{Function}(j,M,M^I/U)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in M\\;j(x)=\n\\{g\\in M^I:\\{i\\in I:g(i)=x\\}\\in U\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Here <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M^I\">\\(M^I\\)</span> is the upstream set of functions <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\to M\">\\(I\\to M\\)</span>.  The displayed value is exactly the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span>-equivalence class of the constant map <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\mapsto x\">\\(i\\mapsto x\\)</span>.  This defines the carrier-level diagonal function with its domain and codomain checked; elementarity is a separate consequence of Łoś's theorem once a language and a structure are supplied.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ultrapower","status":"resolved","id":"80d22bbd3f726e33","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ultrapower]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ultrafilter]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-ultrafilter]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Function}$ is the set-coded function predicate (see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ultrapower","status":"resolved","id":"80d22bbd3f726e33","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M^I/U$ is the ultrapower carrier (see [[58-df-ultrapower]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S\\subseteq V^{2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UltrapowerMap}_S\\subseteq V^{4}","display":false},{"tex":"j,M,I,U\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"M^I/U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UltrapowerMap}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ultrapower\\text{-}map}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{UltrapowerMap}_S(j,M,I,U)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,I)\\land\\operatorname{Function}(j,M,M^I/U)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x\\in M\\;j(x)=\n\\{g\\in M^I:\\{i\\in I:g(i)=x\\}\\in U\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"M^I","display":false},{"tex":"I\\to M","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"i\\mapsto x","display":false}],"bytes":1507,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3852","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-ultrapower-map.md|58-df-zfc-ultrapower-map]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","80d22bbd3f726e33","5e8b8d97b21dd8e8","36d7463d215be751"]}